"P682876623" "My associates have discovered that Crey Industries is developing a new technology that could come in quite useful. The first step is finding out where the device is. My sources tell me that a Crey scientist involved with the project is currently visiting one of Dr. Aeon's labs. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Infiltrate the laboratory and kidnap Dr. Cambrian</A>."
