"P3661111605" "Kidnap Dr. Cambrian"
// SendOffString :
"P729434718" "Try to minimalize casualties if possible. We don't want Arachnos coming after us!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1941930493" "Quickly Get to the Crey scientist before he leaves Dr. Aeon's laboratory!"

